<title>USA: SQUASH-TOURNAMENT OF CHAMPIONS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-TOURNAMENT OF CHAMPIONS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of finals at the Tournament of Champions (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Played on Monday:</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>Jonathan Power (Canada) beat Craig Rowland (Australia) 15-4 9-15 15-10 16-17 15-9</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>3-Cassie Jackman (England) beat 4-Liz Irving (Australia) 10-8 9-6 9-2.</p>
